{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/06/26/8064892/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビ東京「テレ東 音楽祭(初)」に出演致します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂は、21時15分〜23時24分の出演なので、皆さんぜひ見てください(* ^o^ *)！よしろしくです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、東京ドームで行われた「第37回パールボウル」のハームタイムに登場させて頂き、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロマンスのスタートと、新曲の 夏のFree&Easyを披露させて頂きましたo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チアリーダーの皆さんともコラボ出来て楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/06/26/8064892/0001.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、またいつか、乃木坂46みんなでこの場所に立ちたいな＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしっ！頑張ろうｐ(*^-^*)ｑ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、乃木どこ、私も先生やってみたかったなぁーo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、こないだ、かずみんが人生ゲーム教えてくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみん、ななみん、さゆりん、陽菜ちゃんと5人で人生ゲームやったんです(* ^o^ *)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ楽しかったな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんはやっぱ流石だった！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、生ドルに出演させて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっっっちゃ楽しかったあ(っ^ω^)っ フゥフゥッ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂レンジャーできたのも楽しかったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リアルタイムで皆さんとお話出来たのも楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のメッセージ有難うo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あだ名は、もう一年以上前から言ってるけど...さゆにゃんって呼ばれるの恥ずかしいん（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、一時期さゆにゃんをブログでも一切使わなかったりして、自然消滅を試みてたその直後、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"推しメンマフラータオルが発売され、そこにデカデカと「さゆにゃん」って書かれていて、ガァァーーーー(｀；ω；´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式グッツになってしまった以上、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やめれなくなってしまったんです(´^ω^`;)こりゃ参ったー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、気に入って使ってくださってる方も沢山いるし、まぁいいっかなー(´,,^ω^,,`) 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きに呼んでください笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、井上って呼ばれるのだけは、嫌なん(・´_｀・。)む"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら、じゃあ 夏目とかいいじゃん（笑）ってなって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜか昨日は、夏目小百合になった（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく生ドル、楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うございましたo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/06/26/8064892/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに嬉しいご報告です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46が、ヨーロッパ最大の日本文化イベント『第15回 Japan Expo』に、出演させて頂くこととなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん←笑  も出ます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういった機会を与えて頂き、本当に有難いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々と責任を持って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本の良さそして、乃木坂46を伝えてこようと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張りますo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(。・ω・。)正義！"}],"source":"archive"}